+dirty state, and cleanup classification for registered worktrees. It also lists separate Git
+repositories directly under `.agentplane` and its worktrees directory. Sizes are filesystem block
+allocations; shared APFS data can make their sum differ from reclaimable space. A
+`proof_required` entry is only a prompt to inspect `agentplane cleanup merged`. That command
+still requires task closure and provider proof before deletion. Dirty or active worktrees and
+separate repositories remain retained; inspect them individually rather than deleting them based
+on size.
