+### cleanup inspect
+
+Inspect local disk use and worktree cleanup eligibility without deleting files.
+
+Usage:
+
+```text
+agentplane cleanup inspect [options]
+```
+
+Options:
+
+- `--json`: Print machine-readable inventory. (default=false)
+
+Examples:
+
+```sh
+agentplane cleanup inspect
+```
+
+- List worktree and nested repository sizes.
+
+```sh
+agentplane cleanup inspect --json
